{"number":93,"name":"سُورَةُ الضُّحَىٰ","englishName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","englishNameTranslation":"The Morning Hours","numberOfAyahs":11,"items":[{"id":"q:93:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":93,"ayah":1,"surahName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","en":"By the morning brightness","bn":"শপথ পূর্বাহ্নের,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/93/1"},{"id":"q:93:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":93,"ayah":2,"surahName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ","en":"And [by] the night when it covers with darkness,","bn":"শপথ রাত্রির যখন তা গভীর হয়,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/93/2"},{"id":"q:93:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":93,"ayah":3,"surahName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ","en":"Your Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muhammad], nor has He detested [you].","bn":"আপনার পালনকর্তা আপনাকে ত্যাগ করেনি এবং আপনার প্রতি বিরূপও হননি।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/93/3"},{"id":"q:93:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":93,"ayah":4,"surahName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَلَلْءَاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌۭ لَّكَ مِنَ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","en":"And the Hereafter is better for you than the first [life].","bn":"আপনার জন্যে পরকাল ইহকাল অপেক্ষা শ্রেয়।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/93/4"},{"id":"q:93:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":93,"ayah":5,"surahName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","en":"And your Lord is going to give you, and you will be satisfied.","bn":"আপনার পালনকর্তা সত্বরই আপনাকে দান করবেন, অতঃপর আপনি সন্তুষ্ট হবেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/93/5"},{"id":"q:93:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":93,"ayah":6,"surahName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيمًۭا فَـَٔاوَىٰ","en":"Did He not find you an orphan and give [you] refuge?","bn":"তিনি কি আপনাকে এতীমরূপে পাননি? অতঃপর তিনি আশ্রয় দিয়েছেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/93/6"},{"id":"q:93:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":93,"ayah":7,"surahName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآلًّۭا فَهَدَىٰ","en":"And He found you lost and guided [you],","bn":"তিনি আপনাকে পেয়েছেন পথহারা, অতঃপর পথপ্রদর্শন করেছেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/93/7"},{"id":"q:93:8","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":93,"ayah":8,"surahName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَوَجَدَكَ عَآئِلًۭا فَأَغْنَىٰ","en":"And He found you poor and made [you] self-sufficient.","bn":"তিনি আপনাকে পেয়েছেন নিঃস্ব, অতঃপর অভাবমুক্ত করেছেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/93/8"},{"id":"q:93:9","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":93,"ayah":9,"surahName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَأَمَّا ٱلْيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَقْهَرْ","en":"So as for the orphan, do not oppress [him].","bn":"সুতরাং আপনি এতীমের প্রতি কঠোর হবেন না;","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/93/9"},{"id":"q:93:10","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":93,"ayah":10,"surahName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَأَمَّا ٱلسَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْ","en":"And as for the petitioner, do not repel [him].","bn":"সওয়ালকারীকে ধমক দেবেন না।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/93/10"},{"id":"q:93:11","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":93,"ayah":11,"surahName":"Ad-Dhuhaa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَأَمَّا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ","en":"But as for the favor of your Lord, report [it].","bn":"এবং আপনার পালনকর্তার নেয়ামতের কথা প্রকাশ করুন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/93/11"}]}